**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.vite/
**/coverage/
**/*.log
.artifacts/
.codex_work/
backups/
data/
**/chroma_db/
backend/tmp*/
backend/tests/
docs/
